# "Double all damage equipped creature would deal" is every kind of damage from that creature (CR 614.1, 120.3), not only combat
# damage. Gau, Feral Youth (legendary, red and green: worthy, CR 700.16) is equipped on turn 3 (Mjölnir's enters trigger is
# given no target) and attacks: its Rage makes it a 3/3, and its combat damage of 3 becomes 6 (Bot2 20 -> 14). On turn 5 Faithless
# Looting is flashed back from the graveyard, a card leaving it, so Gau deals damage equal to its power to each opponent as the end
# step begins: its power is still 3, the damage it would deal is doubled to 6 (14 -> 8). Nothing else doubles: Bot1 takes none.

